djustments, with the speaker discussing the initial low audio levels and the need to turn them up. The speaker is actively involved in adjusting the levels, expressing concern about potential peaks and the need for guidance from Kiira. Despite these challenges, the speaker is determined to proceed with the performance, even if the result may not be ideal.</p>\n<h2>記事情報</h2>\n<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ep5ed7GZWJg</p>",
